[h2]Build 52 - cover art[/h2]

The mod finally has a cover image. It is amgoz1's original Soulvizier emblem - the horned shield and the glowing SV - carried over from his 2011 mod on ModDB, with our edition name set where his version number used to sit. Used with his written permission. Soulvizier Classic is a port of his work to the Anniversary Edition, and the mark should say so.

[b]Credits[/b]
[list]
[*][b]amgoz1[/b] - Soulvizier (the original mod, and this emblem)
[*][b]soa[/b] - Soulvizier AERA, the merge base for the Anniversary Edition port
[*][b]Dragonlord[/b] - DRX (Diablo Re-eXtinction) visual overhaul
[/list]

[i]No gameplay changes in this update. See the previous entry for the blood cave crash fix and the Toxeus champion changes.[/i]
